The chat application communicates using a custom text-based protocol over TCP sockets. The client sends commands to the server, and the server processes these commands ADD, QUERY and END. For valid commands, the server sends a response starting with "OK" or the requested data. For errors, the server responds with "ERR <error_code> <error_message>".


